Error [E0072]: this loop cannot yield a List because it has no finite exhaustion edge
  --> tests/ui/yielding_loop_nonfinite.jet:2:15
    |
  2 |     values :: loop -> 1
    |               ^^^^
 Why: bare infinite and condition-only loops do not provide the boundary a yielding loop needs
 Fix: remove `->`, or iterate a finite source; use `break value` for one final ordinary-loop result
